{
  "pages": [
    {
      "title": "01-awakening.png",
      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.41,
          "text": "She woke beneath the trees,\nwith cold earth beneath her hands."
        },
        {
          "start": 5.27,
          "end": 6.97,
          "text": "She could not remember her name."
        },
        {
          "start": 7.59,
          "end": 9.51,
          "text": "Or how she had come to this place."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "02-distant-fire.png",
      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0.44,
          "end": 3.49,
          "text": "Beyond the branches,\na village glowed in the dark."
        },
        {
          "start": 4.25,
          "end": 7.06,
          "text": "Firelight. Rooftops. People."
        },
        {
          "start": 7.87,
          "end": 9.37,
          "text": "Perhaps someone there could help."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "03-near-ritual-v2.png",
      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0.39,
          "end": 1.49,
          "text": "She crept closer."
        },
        {
          "start": 2.35,
          "end": 5.34,
          "text": "The villagers stood in a circle\naround a wooden post."
        },
        {
          "start": 5.95,
          "end": 7.09,
          "text": "Their heads were bowed."
        },
        {
          "start": 7.7,
          "end": 10.05,
          "text": "Their voices rose and fell together."
        },
        {
          "start": 10.86,
          "end": 12.76,
          "text": "No one moved to put out the fire."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "04-ritual-overhead-v3.png",
      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0.33,
          "end": 1.98,
          "text": "Then the flames shifted."
        },
        {
          "start": 2.65,
          "end": 4.65,
          "text": "There was a girl tied to the post."
        },
        {
          "start": 5.2,
          "end": 6.28,
          "text": "Her face was hidden."
        },
        {
          "start": 6.96,
          "end": 9.75,
          "text": "But above the smoke,\nthe stranger could see a hood..."
        },
        {
          "start": 10.33,
          "end": 11.44,
          "text": "red as her own."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "05-fright-v5.png",
      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0.46,
          "end": 1.36,
          "text": "She stepped back."
        },
        {
          "start": 1.91,
          "end": 3.74,
          "text": "A twig snapped beneath her heel."
        },
        {
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 7.47,
          "text": "At the edge of the circle,\na villager began to turn."
        },
        {
          "start": 8.12,
          "end": 10.06,
          "text": "She did not wait to see his face."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "06-escape-half-dark-preview.png",
      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0.08,
          "end": 0.82,
          "text": "She ran."
        },
        {
          "start": 1.34,
          "end": 4.5,
          "text": "Past the last pale fence.\nThrough the thorns."
        },
        {
          "start": 4.84,
          "end": 6.34,
          "text": "Into the black forest."
        },
        {
          "start": 6.97,
          "end": 8.94,
          "text": "Behind her, the voices faded."
        },
        {
          "start": 9.47,
          "end": 13.0,
          "text": "She kept running, until she could\nhear only her own breath."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
